 "prompt": "Implement the `ledger` package in this directory so that it follows SPEC.md exactly: `ledger.normalize_date`, `ledger.normalize_amount`, `ledger.normalize_account`, `ledger.process` and the command line `python3 -m ledger FILE`. The stubs in ledger/ show the interface. SPEC.md is the whole contract (rules R1-R51, including the exact error messages and which error is reported when several apply).\n\ntests/test_ledger.py has a few examples (run `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` from this directory); further tests check every rule of SPEC.md. Do not modify SPEC.md or tests/test_ledger.py.\n\nCode must run on /usr/bin/python3 (Python 3.9), the interpreter the checks use; standard library only.",
